Subject: [PATCH] wmediumd: bound observer I/O and fairly service ready descriptors

Initialize listener priorities, rotate ready descriptors within the same priority,
and close backpressured control peers instead of blocking radio processing.
Preserve priority ordering, atomic replies and all RF scheduling parameters.
Self-tests exercise continuously readable peers, callback removal, initialized
listeners and healthy/stalled/disconnected readers. No simulated timing claims.

